  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【秋旅特集】【2026】秋の奈良・吉野山を旅する！世界遺産の錦秋紅葉と洞川温泉・大峰絶景宿10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">千本桜で有名な世界遺産・吉野山。秋には山全体が深紅と黄金色に包み込まれ、大峰山麓の修験道のレトロ温泉「洞川温泉」で名水豆腐と名湯を堪能する至高の10選をご紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-2\">🍁 吉野山・洞川温泉の秋旅で失敗しない3つのチェックポイント</h3>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs text-stone-800 font-medium\">\n    <li>秋の吉野山七曲り・苗名滝・館山夕日桟橋の絶景を至近に臨む客室＆大浴場を厳選</li>\n    <li>地場特産の極上美食（吉野葛・柿の葉寿司・新米コシヒカリ・房総伊勢海老・金目鯛）を味わう料理</li>\n    <li>主要観光地からのアクセスの良さと、ドライブ旅行に安心の無料駐車場完備</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"selection\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">厳選10選！おすすめ絶景温泉宿・名門旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">景勝の宿　芳雲館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.96</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8787/8787.jpg\" alt=\"景勝の宿　芳雲館\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 吉野山の尾根に佇む絶景宿！客室テラスや大浴場から臨む吉野山全景と季節の吉野和食</p>\n      <p><strong>【おすすめポイント】</strong> 吉野山・洞川温泉ならではの絶景パノラマと、極上の源泉温泉＆至高の地場美食。</p>\n      <p><strong>【設備・アクセス】</strong> 天然温泉大浴場完備、敷地内無料駐車場完備、マイカーでの観光拠点に最高の好立地。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8787%2F8787.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 景勝の宿　芳雲館 の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">吉野山 料理旅館 太鼓判</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.96</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/12568/12568.jpg\" alt=\"吉野山 料理旅館 太鼓判\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 蔵王堂参道沿いの好立地！名物吉野本葛を使った「葛懐石」と静かな和室</p>\n      <p><strong>【おすすめポイント】</strong> 吉野山・洞川温泉ならではの絶景パノラマと、極上の源泉温泉＆至高の地場美食。</p>\n      <p><strong>【設備・アクセス】</strong> 天然温泉大浴場完備、敷地内無料駐車場完備、マイカーでの観光拠点に最高の好立地。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F12568%2F12568.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 吉野山 料理旅館 太鼓判 の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">洞川（どろがわ）温泉☆後鬼の湯・宿　花屋徳兵衛</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.96</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8054/8054.jpg\" alt=\"洞川（どろがわ）温泉☆後鬼の湯・宿　花屋徳兵衛\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 創業創業創業500年の老舗温泉旅館！「後鬼の湯」とレトロモダンな館内</p>\n      <p><strong>【おすすめポイント】</strong> 吉野山・洞川温泉ならではの絶景パノラマと、極上の源泉温泉＆至高の地場美食。</p>\n      <p><strong>【設備・アクセス】</strong> 天然温泉大浴場完備、敷地内無料駐車場完備、マイカーでの観光拠点に最高の好立地。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8054%2F8054.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noop